ng is irrational because checking is free. Therefore, seeing the flop for free is the best strategic option.\n\nReason: The opponent limped, giving you the option to check. With 7-4 offsuit being one of the worst starting hands, there is no value in raising, and checking allows you to see the flop for free to see if your hand improves.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
